cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data release, please cite it as below."
title: "OncoGenerator: a probabilistic fuzzy rule-based generator of synthetic clinical and proteomic data for endometrial cancer research"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Arora
    given-names: Neha
    affiliation: University of Newcastle
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NehaAr/OncoGenerator"
url: "https://github.com/NehaAr/OncoGenerator"
abstract: >-
  Seedable generator of fully synthetic endometrial cancer clinical records and
  protein log2 fold-change data, with ground-truth labels, noise/imbalance/batch/missing-data
  scenarios and benchmark scripts. All data are synthetic.
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - proteomics
  - endometrial cancer
  - benchmark
  - bioinformatics
